t[7664]={c="You bring me your old raptor, I give you new one with freshly sharpened claws!  The new raptor will be just as fast as your old one, but with a new look to him.   You can look at the swift raptors here to see what you will have to choose from.",p="You bring me your old raptor, I give you new one with freshly sharpened claws!  The new raptor will be just as fast as your old one, but with a new look to him.   You can look at the swift raptors here to see what you will have to choose from."}
