t[93318]={o="Kill Vulgara the Insatiable in the Shen'dar Highlands and bring her head to Danarii Bellowveil."}
t[93319]={o="Collect 10 Pilfered Windstones from the Highlands Bandits in the Shen'dar Highlands."}
t[93320]={o="Report to Yorana Windyreed at the eastern watchtower in the Gustberry Lowlands."}
t[93341]={o="Investigate the Forlorn Gardens near Shen'dralas and then return to Mithera at the nearby temple."}
t[93362]={o="Cull plants in the Forlorn Garden and then return to Mithera at Shen'dralas."}
t[93383]={o="Wait until you can safely open the Personal Survival Pack."}
t[93394]={o="Locate Magister Kirandis inside the temple of Shen'dralas."}
t[93404]={o="Venture to Maraudon and recover a Vial of Earth Song Water and return it to Woodwyrd at the Forlorn Gardens in Desolace."}
t[93406]={o="Find 4 pieces of Missing Mail in the hills north of Everlook and bring it back to Innkeeper Vizzie."}
t[93407]={o="Find thorn seeds in the forests at the summit of Mount Hyjal and bring them back to Tiala Whitemane."}
t[93422]={o="Kill the Blackthorne Courier and confiscate her message."}
t[93429]={o="Slay 10 Lost Ones in the Fallow Sanctuary."}
t[93430]={o="Find the Lost One Fisherman who stole Pelluk's lure, and take it back."}
t[93443]={o="Deliver the Lost Shipping Crate to Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port in the Riverglades."}
t[93444]={o="Kill a Nightsaber Guardian, then bait out and kill Ghansurok using the Nightsaber Guardian haunch on the northern ridge of the summit. Return with the heart of the chimaera."}
t[93450]={o="Take Vindael's unfinished sword and figure out a way to usher it into the spirit realm, then return the Phantasmal Blade to him at Shen'dralas."}
t[93461]={o="Speak with Rathiril Sunlance and Coriella Calmbreeze in Shen'dar Village."}
t[93464]={o="Find the mage in Desolace who knows about the power of draenethyst."}
t[93465]={o="Take Gimashi's notes on Draenethyst, and bring them back to Azore Aldamort."}
t[93510]={o="Find the anchor on Lake Everstill the War Veteran remembers from childhood."}
t[93521]={o="Take Ve'han's Research Notes to Tiala Whitemane."}
t[93546]={o="Search for Spectral Iron Deposits around Shen'dralas and collect 10 Spectral Iron Ore. Return to Vindael in Shen'dralas once you have found enough."}
t[93547]={o="Plant thorn seeds near the inn, the storage tower, and the grouping of trees at the loyalist druid camp."}
t[93551]={o="Use the Embroidered Scabbard to meet the Veteran of the Third War in Mount Hyjal near the broken cannon in Mourning's Rest."}
t[93552]={o="Collect 15 Windstone Clusters from Raw Windstones in Thendal Grove."}
t[93567]={o="Allow the Veteran of the Third War to tell his story at the broken cannon in Mourning's Rest."}
t[93568]={o="Return the Partially Digested Collar to someone who knows about it. Presumably, they can be found in or near Shen'dralas in Desolace."}
t[93572]={o="Protect the draenei refugees as they pass through Kum'isha's rift to Outland. None of the refugees may die."}
t[93574]={o="Find someone interested in Corpsefeeder's Carapace."}
t[93584]={o="Kill 10 Blackthorne Adepts and 10 Wild-branded Cultists."}
t[93585]={o="Escort Father Tuttle to The Harborage."}
t[93594]={o="Find Woodwyrd in the Forlorn Gardens at Shen'dralas in the Desolace."}
t[93601]={o="Seek out a quilboar of significance at the Bristleback Retreat."}
t[93604]={o="Venture to Razorfen Downs and acquire Virulent Blood of Agamaggan, then return it to Kog'thug the Brave at Bristleback Retreat in the Desolace. Kog'thug felt it worth reminding that the Blood of Agamaggan inside Razorfen Kraul would not be sufficient."}
t[93606]={o="Quell the quilboar's quarrel by bringing Quolga a Benevolent Bouquet and the Virulent Blood of Agamaggan. The flowers to make the bouquet can be acquired at the Forlorn Gardens, near Shen'dralas in the Desolace."}
t[93609]={o="Bring the Forlorn Necklace to Mithera at the temple of Shen'dralas in the Desolace."}
t[93615]={o="Find Shalla'kal's kittens in the wilds of Mount Hyjal."}
t[93617]={o="Dissuade stags from acting as predators."}
t[93644]={o="The text suggests the author of this journal may be somewhere in Shen'dralas."}
t[93663]={o="Find the missing courier, and ensure Dar's shipment is delivered to the Harborage."}
t[93678]={o="Take Azore's transcribed notes back to Magtoor at the Harborage in Swamp of Sorrows."}
t[93679]={o="Watch Onku's vision with Magtoor."}
t[93680]={o="Acquire the Dalaran Sewer Key for Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill."}
t[93684]={o="Find the draenei searching for draenethyst in the Blasted Lands."}
t[93685]={o="Find a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere in the Blasted Lands, and bring it to Kum'isha the Collector. Be warned, this gem is one of the rarest crystals in all of Azeroth. Any creature in these lands could be holding a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere."}
t[93686]={o="Find and return a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere to Kum'isha the Collector."}
t[93735]={o="Find Riaani Nightwind on the west side of Valanaar."}
t[93736]={o="Gather 10 Wind Hollow Essences from Wind Hollows in the Shadowgale Forest."}
t[93737]={o="Speak with Riaani Nightwind and listen to what he has to say."}
t[93738]={o="Report back to Ayessa Dawnsinger in Valanaar."}
t[93739]={o="Speak with Nazgrel in Grommash Hold to receive further instructions. Use the instructions received to locate and speak with Vol'jin, Cairne Bloodhoof, and Lady Sylvanas Windrunner."}
t[93740]={o="Collect 10 Al'Aketh Windstone Charms from the corpses of Al'Aketh cultists in the Gustberry Lowlands."}
t[93746]={o="Confront Belathaan Brightwish along the road to the Shrine of Akir."}
t[93747]={o="Plant the Enchanted Seeds near the Ruined Ballista, the Ruined Catapult, and the Ruined Flying Machine."}
t[93759]={o="Collect 2 Hyjal Venison Cuts from untainted Hyjal Stags and 6 Scarlet Dart Tubers for the hermit's stew."}
t[93773]={o="Report back Ketharas on Mount Hyjal."}
t[93786]={o="Slay 12 Meadowsbrook Farmhands, then return to Krom'rosh with news of your success."}
t[93787]={o="Steal 6 Feed Satchels from the Alliance farm in Meadowsbrook then return to Krom'rosh."}
t[93788]={o="Retrieve 10 Woodworker's Axe from the lumberjacks at Turner's Logging Camp for Kreza Darkthorn in Rog'mar."}
t[93791]={o="Speak with Belann Windwood in Valanaar."}
t[93797]={o="Bring a Wind-Infused Bough to Belann Windwood in Valanaar."}
t[93825]={o="Gather 12 clumps of Moonveil Moss and return to Suma Mossmane."}
t[93826]={o="Defeat 8 Deadwood Totemics and 8 Deadwood Fel-Tenders and return to Elder Pinespeaker."}
t[93827]={o="Collect 16 Enchanted Harpy Amulet and return to Thobon Sapclaw."}
t[93828]={o="Collect 10 Dried Hanging Herbs from around Barkskin Burrow and return them to Fennar Mossmane."}
t[93830]={o="Fill a waterskin provided by Fennar Mossmane at the pond outside of the Deadwood Furbolg den."}
t[93831]={o="Gather 30 Bear Berries from Hyjal and return to Osi Mistpaw."}
t[93832]={o="Destroy 6 Eternal Sentry gargoyles in the destroyed Alliance base in upper Hyjal and return to Elder Mistpaw."}
t[93833]={o="Bring 5 owl bodies to Elder Pinespeaker in Barkskin Burrow in Hyjal."}
t[93834]={o="Gather 10 Burrow Beetle Bits for Dala Fairmaw."}
t[93835]={o="Take the portal to the Rohashi Spires overhead and join Elaadrin Evengale and Ayessa Dawnsinger in their confrontation with High Priestess Lorthuna."}
t[93836]={o="Speak with Talaanis Shadowsong in Valanaar."}
t[93848]={o="Return to Ketharas and inform him of what occurred at the Summit of Eternity."}
t[93926]={o="Find Peacekeeper Vaaniel at the western watchtower."}
t[93927]={o="Collect the note you found near the dead peacekeeper and read it to determine your next steps."}
t[93928]={o="Get the mouse a cookie."}
t[93948]={o="Deliver the Shadowsong Family Signet to Talaanis Shadowsong in Valanaar."}
t[93949]={o="Kill Skyhoppers in Valanaar until you've eliminated 8 Enchanted Skyhoppers."}
t[93951]={o="Collect 8 Hippogryph Down feathers in the Shen'dar Highlands."}
t[93952]={o="Defeat 9 Deadwood Den Guardians and return to Brerufa."}
t[93958]={o="Speak with Valennia Stormfist inside the inner sanctum at the Shrine of Akir."}
t[93963]={o="Speak with Randal Emerson in Stormwind Keep to receive further instructions. Use the instructions received to locate and speak with King Magni Bronzebeard, High Tinker Mekkatorque, and Tyrande Whisperwind."}
t[93971]={o="Bring the report to Krom'rosh at Rog'mar."}
t[93976]={o="Deliver the blade to Kreza Darkthorn's acquaintance at the docks east of Rog'mar."}
t[94003]={o="Reclaim the Skybreaker Bulwark from Zaal Stormshield at the Shrine of Akir."}
t[94004]={o="Acquire the items requested by the customer and deliver them to the location marked on your map. This writ must be in your possession to complete the transaction."}
t[94006]={o="Speak with Urs'endris near the falls northeast of Valanaar."}
t[94007]={o="Report to Quel'ana Quickgale in Valanaar."}
t[94013]={o="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Vuldren Alpha in the Gustberry Lowlands. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel'ana Quickgale in Valanaar."}
t[94050]={o="Speak to Quel'dora Quickgale in Valanaar."}
