t[97412]={o="Bring a Lightforge Belt and a set of Lightforge Gauntlets to Mokvar in Orgrimmar."}
t[97413]={o="Return to Mokvar in Orgrimmar with a set of Lightforge Boots, Lightforge Legplates and Lightforge Spaulders."}
t[97420]={o="Acquire 4 Drums of Crude Oil from the Venture Co. operations at Lake Nazferiti, then return to Knaz Blunderflame in Stranglethorn Vale."}
t[97446]={o="Inspect the riding kodos to choose your first mount."}
