t[97540]={o="Show the newly quenched Tooga the way back to his wife, Torta."}
t[97558]={o="Bring Shelene Rhobart 8 Duskbat Wing Membranes, 6 Darkhound Hides and 3 Vile Fin Murloc Skin."}
t[97583]={o="Purchase Nutritious Slime Sludge and return to your befriended excitable slime. If it seems tired, try dancing with it again to catch its attention."}
